From 6dbeae563e6d8e46921293593be9bb6b41287fb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Experiment <codex-experiment@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 12:03:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt6797: compare firmware-lifetime fixed RX format

D2 refused an enable-time 94/142 packet after earlier close-time differences of the opposite sign. Configure the exact observed mask once before scan-ready, with startup normal-credit ownership and the same absolute 100 ms limit. Keep data windows local and reject join-owned mask writes.

Preserve RX equality, complete transfer, poison/no-copy, crypto and lifetime ceilings. Configuration credit is not firmware application, queue retirement or integrity proof. GTK, rekey, reuse and reconnect remain disabled.

Internal experiment archive, synthetic non-certifying author identity; no DCO certification and not an upstream submission.
---
